  "priorExpiration": "1997-08-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 2311.01 Application Requirements.\n\n(a) Non-exempt homestead food operations shall apply for a Class H food service license.\n\n(b) Non-exempt homestead food operations applying for a Class H license shall comply with all of the application requirements of He-P 2304.01 except that:\n\n(1) They shall not be required to submit the plan review application required under He-P 2304.01(a)(5) and wastewater items required under He-P 2304.01(a)(4) and He-P 2304.07;\n\n(2) They shall submit process review documentation in accordance with He-P 2311.03, as applicable; and\n\n(3) They shall also submit the following:\n\na. A copy of one finished product label which meets the requirements of He-P 2311.04 below; and\n\nb. A list of all products to be manufactured.\n\nSource. #2802, eff 8-8-84; ss by #5051, eff 1-22-91; EXPIRED 1-22-97\n\nNew. #6503, Interim, eff 4-25-97; EXPIRED 8-23-97\n\nNew. #6722, eff 3-27-98; ss by #7893, eff 5-21-03; ss by #9857-A, eff 2-1-11; ss by #10199-A, eff 10-12-12; ss by #10867, eff 6-25-15; ss by #12852, eff 8-20-19",
